<title>USA: Hillenbrand Industries Inc Q3 Aug 31 net up.</title>
<headline>Hillenbrand Industries Inc Q3 Aug 31 net up.</headline>
<dateline>BATESVILLE, Ind. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			    08/31/96  09/02/95  08/31/96   09/02/95</p>
<p> Net revenues	   $404,073 $398,716 $1,262,130 $1,199,852</p>
<p> Operating profit	 56,210   48,788    174,980    145,732</p>
<p>Income before income taxes</p>
<p>				56,870   45,601    168,870    135,017</p>
<p> Income taxes	     22,186   19,715     67,210     53,872</p>
<p> Net income		 34,684   25,886    101,660     81,145</p>
<p> Earnings/common share     .50	.37	 1.46	 1.15</p>
<p>NOTE: Current Q3 results include after-tax gain of $1.9 million for sale of Block Medical. The company also recognized related income tax benefit of about $6.0 million, which was essentially offset by a year-to-date increase in the effective tax rate.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
